OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA band of rain will move from
OL,6,Fsouthern Scotland into northern
OL,7,FEngland and Wales. To the north it
OL,8,Fwill be breezy with bright spells and
OL,9,Fsome showers, whilst fog patches will
OL,10,Fclear further south to leave some very
OL,11,Fwarm sunshine.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FPatchy rain will sink
OL,14,Fsoutheastwards across England and
OL,15,FWales overnight. Heavy and blustery
OL,16,Fshowers are likely in the far north
OL,17,Fand northwest. Clear spells, patchy
OL,18,Ffog and grass frost elsewhere.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
