OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FMost southern and eastern
OL,6,Fareas will have a fine day on Saturday
OL,7,Fwith some sunshine. Cloudier in the
OL,8,Fnorth and west with scattered showers,
OL,9,Fthese blustery in the northwest.
